      "activity_description": "Design MessageBus SPI extension for deleting stream bindings, per-binder deletion semantics (Redis/Rabbit/Kafka/local), and the hook into the stream destroy path.",
      "most_likely_effort": 8
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A03",
      "activity_name": "U1 implementation: delete queues/topics on destroy",
      "activity_description": "Implement the bus-admin delete operations for each binder and wire them into StreamDeployer destroy/undeploy so coupled queues/topics are removed with the stream.",
      "most_likely_effort": 40
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A04",
      "activity_name": "U1 testing: destroy-path cleanup verification",
      "activity_description": "Unit and integration tests verifying queues/topics are removed on stream destroy across supported binders, including failure and retry handling.",
      "most_likely_effort": 24
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A05",
      "activity_name": "U2 design: stale queue/topic cleanup",
      "activity_description": "Design resource naming conventions, stale-resource detection against ZooKeeper state, and the admin/shell cleanup command semantics.",
      "most_likely_effort": 8
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A06",
      "activity_name": "U2 implementation: stale resource detection and cleanup command",
      "activity_description": "Implement broker scans by naming prefix, comparison with existing streams in ZooKeeper, and the shell/REST cleanup action for orphaned queues/topics.",
      "most_likely_effort": 24
    },
